  "description": "This 29er has cross-country geometry designed specifically for women with a lightweight frame with a PowerCore bottom bracket for ideal pedaling efficiency to conquer those serious climbs. Pique 29 offers 100 mm of front and rear travel, tuned for women and on the leading Maestro Suspension Technology. Complete with a dropper post, the Pique 29 is built for cross-country racers and riders alike. The integrated design accommodates downtube water bottles on all size frames, XS-L. Built with a lightweight ALUXX SL-Grade aluminum frame, the Pique 29 offers a premium ride at a winning price. The 29-inch wheels ensure bike handling is stable and fast, boasts itself to precision cornering and bump-reducing qualities.",
